# Go tooling writes LF, and gofmt reports a CRLF file as unformatted. Without
# this, a checkout on Windows converts line endings and every source file
# looks misformatted to CI.
*.go text eol=lf
*.mod text eol=lf
*.sum text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf

# Audio fixtures and golden PCM must never be translated.
*.m4a binary
*.wav binary
*.pcm binary
*.aac binary
